CrashGUI-File                                          #
backmain.tga      		                       # Background picture
$ID intrface/controls.cgf MenuTitle		                               # Title string
full    				               # "blinds" background type
default 					       # default group
default                 			       # padding distance of elements to their parent frame (in pixels)
default             				       # additional left/right padding of elements towards the center of their parent

Next:		                                       #
